body:
I use 2.7.1 version.

This works in your codesandbox, but not in my environment:

```
    search.addWidget(
        instantsearch.widgets.hits({
            container: '.hits',
            templates: {
                empty: 'No results',
                item: '<strong>Hit {{objectID}}</strong>: {{{_highlightResult.name.value}}}'
            },
            escapeHits: true,
            transformItems: function (items) {
                return items.map(function (item) {
                    console.log(item);
                    return item;
                });
            },
        })
    );
```

Is it just because of a version difference? Or it have to do with Indexes "Ranking and Sorting" configurations?

Edit: I changed instantsearchjs version in your codesandbox from 2.10.4 to - https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/instantsearch.js@2.7.1/dist/instantsearch.min.js - and now example doesn't work, so looks like it's a version difference. I just wonder now how many things changing from 2.7.1 to 2.10.4 will break for me :D ?

Edit: I changed version in my code to 2.10.4 and was able to get inside transformItems method.
